{
  "meta": {
    "name": "Singapore MRT network (heavy rail only)",
    "snapshot_date": "2026-11-18",
    "units": "minutes",
    "description": "Operational Singapore MRT lines (NSL, EWL incl. Changi Airport branch, NEL, CCL, DTL, TEL). LRT systems are excluded. Transfers only exist inside official interchange stations; there are no out-of-station walking links.",
    "notes": [
      "next_min on a stop = in-train time (run + dwell) to the following stop of the route. Estimated as 1.1 min (dwell, acceleration) + 0.8 min/km of track, where track length = straight-line distance + 15% of the first 2 km; rounded to the nearest 0.5 min.",
      "Interchange 'min' values are walking + average waiting penalties (estimates).",
      "The Changi Airport branch (CG) runs as a Tanah Merah - Changi Airport shuttle, so it is modelled as its own platform layer (CGL) with a change of train at Tanah Merah.",
      "Circle Line: Stage 6 (Keppel, Cantonment, Prince Edward Road) opened 12 Jul 2026 and closed the loop; Bayfront and Marina Bay CCL codes became CC34 and CC33.",
      "Stops with an 'opens' date are skipped when solving for an earlier date (TEL Stage 5 and DTL Stage 3 extension open 26 Dec 2026).",
      "Not included (not open): Mount Pleasant TE10, Marina South TE21, Founders' Memorial TE22A, Bukit Brown CC18, Sungei Kadut NS6, Brickland NS3A, Jurong Region Line, Cross Island Line.",
      "Coordinates are approximate station locations (4 d.p.) used only for drawing the map."
    ]
  },
  "parameters": {
    "reversal_penalty_min": 3.0,
    "reversal_penalty_note": "Time to alight and catch a train in the opposite direction (cross platform + wait), also applied at line terminals. Set to 0 to use the pure two-layer platform graph."
  },
